WEBVTT

00:03:58.724 --> 00:04:00.776
and if you're an octopus or a cephalopod,

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:03.976
you need to really understand
how to use your surroundings to hide.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.777
In the next scene, you're going to see
a nice coral bottom.

00:04:06.801 --> 00:04:08.841
And you see that an octopus
would stand out

00:04:08.865 --> 00:04:11.448
very easily there if you couldn't
use your camouflage,

00:04:11.472 --> 00:04:13.573
use your skin to change color and texture.

00:04:13.597 --> 00:04:15.976
Here's some algae in the foreground --

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.751
and an octopus.

00:04:18.775 --> 00:04:20.175
Ain't that amazing?

00:04:21.847 --> 00:04:25.976
Now, Roger spooked him,
so he took off in a cloud of ink,

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.976
and when he lands, the octopus says,
"Oh, I've been seen.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.477
The best thing to do is to get
as big as I can get."